+## Key Differences from Original
+
+| Feature | Original | This Fork |
+|---------|----------|-----------|
+| Android barcode library | Google ML Kit (closed source) | Pure Kotlin ([limpbrains/qr](https://github.com/limpbrains/qr)) |
